00:04:57,272 --> 00:05:03,272
The magic's back, warts and all.

2
00:09:54,545 --> 00:10:00,545
Nanny McPhee and the Big Bang is a comedy, fantasy,
family film directed by Susanna White.

3
00:14:51,818 --> 00:14:57,818
Nanny McPhee appears at the door of a harried young mother who is trying
to run the family farm while her husband is away at war.

4
00:19:49,090 --> 00:19:55,090
But once she’s arrived, Nanny discovers that the children are fighting a war of
their own against two spoiled city cousins who have just moved in.

5
00:24:46,363 --> 00:24:52,363
Relying on everything from a flying motorcycle and a statue that comes to life to a tree-climbing piglet
and a baby elephant, Nanny uses her magic to teach her mischievous charges five new lessons.

6
